  "notes": "{囲|かこ}む means to surround or encircle, often with the nuance of gathering together around something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{囲|かこ}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes a state of being surrounded, often in passive form {囲|かこ}まれて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{食卓|しょくたく}→食卓：03246_shokutaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{囲|かこ}む: to gather around the dining table\n- ⟦{鍋|なべ}→鍋：01038_nabe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{囲|かこ}む: to sit around a hot pot\n- ⟦{敵|てき}→敵：03546_teki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{囲|かこ}む: to surround the enemy\n- ⟦{塀|へい}→塀：03613_hei⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{囲|かこ}まれて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: to be enclosed by a fence\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{囲|かこ}まれる: to be surrounded by people\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{囲|かこ}い→囲い：12039_kakoi⟧: enclosure, fence\n- ⟦{取|と}り{囲|かこ}む→取り囲む：20925_torikakomu⟧: to encircle, surround completely",
